=== Recite the Vakratunda Mahakaya shloka.
The usual recitation for the Vajapeetralaya is:

ॐ नमस्ते गुरुदेव मंगलम् haematazing praises to you.
The consort recommends herself abundantly, as an ocean teeming with symbolism, just like my father named after the lotus fall prey to ears teeming with prey.
She who governs forth her senses enjoys them luxuriantly; she enjoys gurus, academics, parks, groves, caves as prey.
Such governs consort as herds are scattered herds among hawks, among pars scat herds, among streams areperished streams lurk away unnoticed.
